1
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:28,260
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:31,500
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,100
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,700
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:40,060
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:43,100
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:46,060
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:49,420
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,400
I'm hallucinating again.

10
00:01:18,390 --> 00:01:23,330
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

11
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:29,340
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

12
00:01:32,470 --> 00:01:37,340
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

13
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:41,120
Not a hallucination.

14
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:42,920
It's real.

15
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:44,680
The real deal.

16
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:50,400
You...

17
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:51,520
Don't ask why I'm here.

18
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:53,560
I wanted to come
the moment you took off.

19
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,410
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

20
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,800
Let's get you to school.

21
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,640
As for the rest...

22
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:05,640
We can talk later.

23
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:12,840
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

24
00:02:13,060 --> 00:02:19,980
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

25
00:02:20,550 --> 00:02:24,220
♪I'll read every look on your face♪

26
00:02:24,220 --> 00:02:24,800
=Quite The Girl=

27
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,350
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

28
00:02:25,350 --> 00:02:25,900
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

29
00:02:25,900 --> 00:02:27,180
=Episode 12=

30
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:34,100
♪Gemini's joy, a little magic for you♪

31
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,480
Class is over?

32
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:54,520
What's...

33
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,040
Mind if I come in first?

34
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,960
I need a favor.

35
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:04,380
(Monet)

36
00:03:13,620 --> 00:03:15,880
(Monet)

37
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,000
What do you need?

38
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,560
I went to Xizi City

39
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,080
to look for someone.

40
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:22,160
My mom had a close friend
when she was young.

41
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,840
Then she married and moved to Xizi.

42
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,200
They lost touch.

43
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,680
While looking for her, I found out

44
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,160
she passed away.

45
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,520
But I heard she had a daughter.

46
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:32,960
And oddly enough,

47
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:34,760
she's at Royal Imperial Academy of Arts.

48
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:40,280
You want me to find her?

49
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,680
You go to the same school.

50
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,160
You know the scene.

51
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:45,120
Okay.

52
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:47,120
I'll ask around tomorrow.

53
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,760
One more favor to ask.

54
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:53,720
Go ahead.

55
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:58,240
I just landed this afternoon.

56
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:00,080
Something came up.

57
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,840
My passport and wallet were stolen.

58
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,960
The police said it'd take some time.

59
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:07,080
Can I crash here a few days?

60
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:10,200
Thanks. I'll check the bedroom.

61
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,600
The bed can't fit two people.

62
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:20,480
It's my bed. You take the couch.

63
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,000
It's fine.

64
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,520
I'll take the floor.

65
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:42,320
(Your parents are dead.)

66
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:44,520
(You eat and live under our roof.)

67
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,800
(Just a stray dog we feed.)

68
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:47,840
(Starting today,)

69
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:48,800
(you sleep here.)

70
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:51,080
(Lock Lu Mingyu up.)

71
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:52,280
(Three days inside.)

72
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:01,520
Starting today, this is your place.

73
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:06,040
Why here?

74
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,160
Easier to search.

75
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,240
Top-tier security here.

76
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:12,040
It helps you avoid a lot of hassle.

77
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:13,960
Oh, right.

78
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,160
The studio came with it.

79
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,400
Use it as you like.

80
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:20,240
I bought the place anyway.

81
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,080
Also...

82
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,520
The chef and dietitian live next door.

83
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,640
So you don't have to

84
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:28,840
keep running to the cafeteria.

85
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:31,160
You'll have more time
to help me find her.

86
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,080
If I recall correctly,

87
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:39,000
someone said yesterday

88
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,920
his wallet and passport were stolen.

89
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,120
And he was broke.

90
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,600
Right.

91
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:46,600
But this morning the police called.

92
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:48,000
They said my wallet and passport

93
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,320
was returned by someone.

94
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:52,520
Guess my luck changed after you.

95
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:56,320
When do we look for the person?

96
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,280
Once I get the info.

97
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:02,400
I'll get your room ready.

98
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:27,520
Hello?

99
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,440
(I found Auntie Chen's daughter.)

100
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:32,280
(My mom wants me
to marry her in Xiangjiang.)

101
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:38,640
(Meet me at the theater.)

102
00:07:44,620 --> 00:07:49,300
♪They all believe♪

103
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,040
Okay.

104
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:55,620
♪Love begins at first sight♪

105
00:07:58,500 --> 00:08:03,500
♪When Cupid's arrow flies♪

106
00:08:04,460 --> 00:08:09,100
♪Through two gazing eyes♪

107
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:16,380
♪But they don't remember♪

108
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:21,860
♪Passing by under green lights♪

109
00:08:23,940 --> 00:08:26,940
♪In the airport corner♪

110
00:08:27,020 --> 00:08:30,020
♪Bags between us♪

111
00:08:30,340 --> 00:08:35,740
♪Or someone dialed the wrong number♪

112
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:42,980
♪Fate's signal's always weak♪

113
00:08:43,220 --> 00:08:49,900
♪Close, then apart,
teasing us one by one♪

114
00:08:50,420 --> 00:08:55,960
♪Cover both ears, hide all the clues♪

115
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:56,560
Here you are.

116
00:08:58,920 --> 00:08:59,680
Congratulations.

117
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,320
Is that all?

118
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,160
Nothing else to say?

119
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:08,760
Here's your house key.

120
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,560
So eager to cut ties with me?

121
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:18,160
An ex's last dignity

122
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:21,440
is stepping aside for the new fiancee.

123
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:30,400
Ex...

124
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,440
So there was more

125
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:35,760
than just using each other.

126
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:38,240
I remember you said

127
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:39,960
you wanted to marry me.

128
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,960
Changed so fast?

129
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,440
A promise is a promise.

130
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:46,360
Guess Duan Xiuming's

131
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:47,880
promises don't mean much.

132
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,920
Whether my word counts

133
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,400
depends on who's listening.

134
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:53,440
I don't care.

135
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:55,720
Lu Mingyu.

136
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,800
You don't care if I marry her?

137
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,000
I don't...

138
00:10:08,530 --> 00:10:14,980
♪You're all my joy, my every heartbeat♪

139
00:10:16,180 --> 00:10:21,980
♪I want to grow old with you♪

140
00:10:23,620 --> 00:10:29,360
♪Sharing one umbrella in the rain♪

141
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,160
Lu Mingyu.

142
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,360
If you ask, I'll stay.

143
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:35,640
And then what?

144
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,200
Make one woman's plea

145
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,600
an excuse to betray another?

146
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:44,360
♪You're all my joy, all my pride♪

147
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,560
Then ask her yourself

148
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,840
if she needs your blessing.

149
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,600
This is my mom's song.

150
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:28,480
Lu Mingye.

151
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,400
You still owe me a tenner.

152
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,360
(Xiuming, wait here.)

153
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:40,520
(I'll get Auntie Chen.)

154
00:11:43,580 --> 00:11:47,260
(Ten years ago)

155
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,480
Hey, mister.

156
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:53,000
I lost my candy.

157
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,560
Can I borrow a tenner?

158
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,000
Fine.

159
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:01,840
Here you go.

160
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,960
Thank you.

161
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:09,460
♪The moment we passed by♪

162
00:12:09,460 --> 00:12:13,060
♪My heartbeat lingered in my ear♪

163
00:12:13,060 --> 00:12:18,020
♪Your face froze before my eyes♪

164
00:12:18,690 --> 00:12:20,920
♪I'm always here♪

165
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:21,680
It's you.

166
00:12:22,190 --> 00:12:25,560
♪Wherever you go♪

167
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:26,040
Yes.

168
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:28,000
It's me.

169
00:12:28,940 --> 00:12:31,300
♪Wherever you are♪

170
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:34,860
♪Wherever you go♪

171
00:13:03,850 --> 00:13:09,000
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

172
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:15,020
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

173
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:22,700
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

174
00:13:23,640 --> 00:13:29,520
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

175
00:13:31,150 --> 00:13:37,150
♪A love letter written in song♪

176
00:13:37,980 --> 00:13:43,470
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

177
00:13:45,310 --> 00:13:51,620
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

178
00:13:51,930 --> 00:13:58,520
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

179
00:13:58,520 --> 00:14:05,040
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

180
00:14:06,270 --> 00:14:08,730
♪Close your eyes and count♪

181
00:14:08,730 --> 00:14:15,353
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

182
00:14:15,353 --> 00:14:17,740
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
